<title>UK: World Bank sets $100 mln structured 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $100 mln structured 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Banca Commerciale Italiana.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     *6.8	MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.825    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE, THEN 13.0 PCT LESS 12-MONTH</p>
<p>		LIBOR ON A BOND BASIS. MINIMUM 4.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR MARCH 2002</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
